UID:event-hayy-cinema@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T131814Z
DTSTART:20260618T060000Z
DTEND:20260715T150000Z
SUMMARY:Hayy Cinema | “Kef Hayyak?” 3rd Edition Screenings and Awards Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the screenings of the third edition of “Kef Hayyak?” cohort’s films! “Kef Hayyak?” is a unique documentary filmmaking challenge that invites aspiring filmmakers to capture the essence of their neighborhoods in Jeddah through their own lens—using only their phones. Building on the success of its first two editions\, the programme launched an open call for its third edition in December 2025\, selecting 13 projects for development based on the quality and originality of their creative proposals.
LOCATION:Hayy Jameel
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-hayy-cinema.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-jameel-library-summer-reading-challenge@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T131814Z
DTSTART:20260701T060000Z
DTEND:20260831T150000Z
SUMMARY:Jameel Library | Summer Reading Challenge
DESCRIPTION:Jameel Library invites you to build a relationship with the library through curiosity\, discovery\, and spending time exploring its resources. This challenge celebrates the moments you spend here cultivating new interests and passions rather than the number of books you finish. Throughout July and August\, participants will receive prizes based on the number of hours they spend at Jameel Library\, turning every visit into a small seed planted among the shelves\, and nurtured with every new visit.
LOCATION:Hayy Jameel
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-jameel-library-summer-reading-challenge.html
END:VEVENT
